      {
        "id": "model-code-equation-map",
        "moduleId": "implementation-map",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "代码与公式逐行对照",
        "markdown": "把教材代码按行对照公式：\n\n1. `Z = sigmoid(X @ W_xz + H @ W_hz + b_z)`\n2. `R = sigmoid(X @ W_xr + H @ W_hr + b_r)`\n3. `H_tilda = tanh(X @ W_xh + (R * H) @ W_hh + b_h)`\n4. `H = Z * H + (1 - Z) * H_tilda`\n5. `Y = H @ W_hq + b_q`\n\n注意第 3 行先做 $\\mathbf{R}$ 与 $\\mathbf{H}$ 的逐元素乘再乘权重矩阵；第 4 行使用更新前的旧 $\\mathbf{H}$ 计算新状态，赋值完成后才把新状态带到下一时间步。循环顺序与公式中的下标一一对应。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-model-code"
          ]
        }
      },
